---
source: crates/rdlt-certify/tests/it/cli.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8_lossy(&certified.stdout)"
---
certification of io.rapidbyte.memory
  pass P-HANDSHAKE
  pass P-ORDER
  skip P-ROLE: the connector serves the destination role too
  pass P-LIMITS
  pass P-HEARTBEAT
  pass P-MALFORMED
  pass P-CREDIT
  pass S-CHECK
  pass S-DISCOVER
  pass S-PLAN
  pass S-RESUME
  pass S-PARTITION
  pass S-STOP
  skip S-BARRIER: no stream checkpoints on demand
  skip S-ACK: the source does not tell where it stands
  skip K-SOURCE: no kill interrupted the load (kill seed 515): it ended first
